  -  air conditioner;

  -  beside lamp;

  -  wardrobe.

The textures are included and there are two files with different render type.Beside tables, curtains, wardrobe, air conditioner, bed and beside lamp  are modular.

The scene was created in 3ds max 2015 and used the coronarender. The whole scene was also manually converted to vray and tested.

  - polys: 58250

  - Verts: 62162______________________________________________

dimensions of one bag: 45x37x55 cm.
Formats:

  - 3dsmax2015 (Corona 2,Vray 3.6)

  - FBX (Corona,Vray)

  - OBJ (Scanline)

  - 
Texture

  - the model is in the center of coordinates;

  - strip path to all textures have been removed;

  - Model tested for the presence of all the textures;

  - plugins are not required;

  - Units used: mm;

  - all textures are seamless;

  - All objects, textures and materials have their names;

  - Fbx formats are co-located separately for VRay and CoronaRender.

  - For formats OBJ,Fbx models have been converted to Editable Mesh

  - In OBJ format, the materials are translated into Scanline

  - The model is fully prepared for work, just drag it into your project.

  - enjoy...

