Polygon Count127684 polygons127847 vertices
//IMAGE PRESENTATION//All preview images are rendered using cycles render v2.81.
//ADDITIONAL INFORMATION//The exchange formats might show some anomalies.The model is unwrapped and is non-overlappingThe model contains textures.

[ABOUT]
This pack contains 3 furniture models. The models are classified as mid-poly because the polycount is larger than low-poly. But models can be used in the interior and other similar projects. Each model has its own set of textures and material (PBR, metallic workflow).
Models Summary:

  - Chair 29330 tris, 15012 verts;

  - Loveseat 50358 tris, 25628 verts;

  - Ottoman 16788 tris, 8453 verts;

Textures Summary:
PBR-materials were created for all the models. The resolution of all the textures is 2k. And the map set includes albedo, metallic/smoothness, normal, occlusion and emission maps.
Also for all materials are used detail albedo and detail normal maps.

