Hi, friend!Here you can see a cool pack of models for interior visualisation. It is a High Quality game ready (Low Poly) asset which you can freely use in any (commercial/non-commercial) purposes without any additional fees. You can use it in a project of any type wheather it is a game/movie or visualisation. The pack includes a sofa, an armchair with a decent fabric PBR materials and a small plastic & glass table.
Speaking about the polycount, it is quite a low number for a such a photorealistic asset.
Total polycount: 13k faces! (For all meshes included in pack) 
SEPARATE MESHES:

  - An armchair - 6.144 polygons;

  - A Sofa - 6.976 polygons;

  - A Table - 99 polygons;

  - A Glass part of the table - 1 polygon. 

TEXTURES:

  - Sofa+Armchair: Albedo/Diffuse - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Sofa+Armchair: Roughness/Detail Albedo - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Sofa+Armchair: Normal Map - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Table: Albedo/Diffuse - 4K (4096 X 4096).

FEATURES:

  - Separate meshes, easy to animate;

  - All of the popular file formats (FBX, OBJ, DAE, BLEND, X3D, STL);

  - File names (textures & meshes) are simple to understand, no mess in files;

  - Multi-style design;

  - Smart polycount;

  - Clean topology;

  - Realistic shading;

  - PBR texture maps;

  - Royalty-free licence.

ADVANTAGES BRIEFLY:Inteligent file naming, no mess in 3D file - no lamps/presentational planes/cameras/other trash. All meshes are centered by the world origin, has normal scale. No flipped normals.
RECOMMENDATION:To use all or the advantages of this pack, download my other assets (they are the same style and quality). You can get them from my artist's page for free or for a good price.
NOTE 0:The glass part of the table was made a separate part in case your game/render engine didn't recognize blender's transperency so you could easily remove it and place a standard glass object on top of the table.
NOTE 1:it is important to note I am the only creator of all models in this pack and I ALLOW using them in any commercial and non-commercial purposes.
NOTE 2:If you have any questions/suggestions or issues with the asset, feel free to write me on my e-mail or use the comment section (or direct messaging).I am always ready to help you!
Best wishes,Your 3D artist,Andriy Bobchuk.
